ved-subset-owner-decision.schema.v1.json`\n- `artifacts/method-map/v1-9709/v1-served-subset-owner-decision-contract.validator-result.json`\n\n## Contract facts\n- Exactly 8 `decisions[]` rows required.\n- Candidate ids must match the source candidate packet exactly.\n- Owner decision enum is exactly `approve_for_later_served_subset | reject_from_minimal_trusted_subset | defer_needs_more_evidence`.\n- `runtime_path_eligible` is fixed to false.\n- `phase_b2_mutation_eligible` is fixed to false.\n\n## Verification\n- Independent schema/validator assertions => pass\n- `git diff --cached --check` => pass\n- `npm run workflow:codex-preflight -- --json` => warning only for staged #1126 files before commit; artifact guard and ratchet healthy","created_at":"2026-07-01T16:46:28Z","updated_at":"2026-07-01T16:49:26Z","closed_at":"2026-07-01T16:49:26Z","merged_at":"2026-07-01T16:49:26Z","merge_commit_sha":"278f5896da10d3abfd3f5619cef6a334bb1743fc","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1136/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1136/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/issues/1136/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/statuses/fbf352c2c4e04e4c4ca3cbecdbeca6e42cd25ccb","head":{"label":"Samsen879:task/1126-owner-decision-contract","ref":"task/1126-owner-decision-contract","sha":"fbf352c2c4e04e4c4ca3cbecdbeca6e42cd25ccb","user":{"login":"Samsen879","id":172257175,"node_id":"U_kgDOCkRvlw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172257175?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users